  "2026-10-27T16:16:25.177Z",codex-agent,"R7 monotonic-precondition class: clean starting head 7eac04c, fetched main has no additional commits. Timestamp equality cannot certify a read revision. Auditing all sync/import/export local intent, scalar/status/graph/base writes, resolution apply/replay and read-only refresh snapshots. Existing follow-up pm-ado-sdk-history-fence now links upstream unbraind/pm-cli#1576, which is open and documents the missing native expected-item-hash option and a scoped beforeMutation workaround. Will use a locked SDK history-head or expected-hash capability if the public API permits it; no package-defined storage locks or lifecycle reimplementation. Public PR reviewThreads is empty; no additional nonblocking inline findings supplied."
  "2026-10-27T16:36:14.583Z",codex-agent,"R7 SDK gap assessment: upstream unbraind/pm-cli#1576 is OPEN. The named SDK match API is adopted, but its timestamp-only use does not close the monotonic-precondition requirement. No safe native expected-history/hash parameter exists in the pinned public lifecycle/bulk API. Do not interpret the earlier 2/2 capability-adoption result as proof that stale writes are prevented under a fixed clock. Affected current call sites: sync.ts commitLocal covers local-prepared/local-replanned, scalar/provenance/link/graph writes, close-prepared/status/assignment/recovery and agreement; resolution.ts apply publishes agreement with the same timestamp match. Resolution prepare uses a mutable document digest and also needs a history-bound plan to reject ABA; settle has an additional last-prepare-history check. Refresh performs no mutations and its current snapshot re-read is not a conditional commit. Full details and exact missing signatures are on pm-ado-sdk-history-fence. No production behavior is changed in this gap-reporting round; the blocking class remains open pending SDK support."
  "2026-10-27T16:39:04.967Z",codex-agent,"Current R7 fixed-clock acceptance probe exits 1: 18/18 boundary cases fail (19 failures including the parent test), zero skips/cancellations. Import sites: local-prepared, scalar update, close-prepared, close, assignment, agreement; export sites: local-prepared, link/update, agreement. Each runs both a concurrent edit and ABA with Date fixed to the inspected millisecond, verifies native history length and last record hash advance, and requires a typed conflict plus unchanged item state. The current native SDK path still accepts stale writes; no replacement or passing revert proof is claimed. Probe copies bounded source/test files to a disposable non-git directory and uses the real SDK, leaving package runtime and tracker untouched. Previous-head CI 40521736562 has now completed: all four jobs fail the unchanged branch threshold at 99.36%; each V8 suite passes 712/712, zero failures/skips/cancellations, 100% lines/functions. AST statement pass did not run. Separate uncovered test paths in contracts/moves/resolution/sync will be covered without weakening assertions or thresholds."
  "2026-10-27T17:08:24.890Z",codex-agent,"R7 focused results: 5/5 new native schema-race, selection/lookup, unscoped-duplicate, missing-provenance and unlinked-record cases pass. Complete contracts/moves suites pass 32/32 with 100% lines/branches/functions for both modules; prior focused resolution/read-back checkpoint passes 30/30. Typecheck/build/build:test/docstrings pass (114 declarations). The native-precondition probe is linked and was run through pinned pm test: it fails as expected on the unresolved SDK contract, with sanitized 18 boundary receipts / 19 reported failures, zero skips/cancellations. Added npm run test:native-precondition to release validation and Node CI so ordinary green tests cannot hide this blocker. No existing assertions, 100-percent thresholds or fixture timeouts weakened. Native sync/resolution/relation concurrency is not claimed fixed; missing public signature and upstream #1576 are recorded on pm-ado-sdk-history-fence. Full npm/Bun gates run serially next on the source commit, at most two workers."
  "2026-10-27T17:28:58.927Z",codex-agent,"R7 local npm full gate on c0c8688 exits 1 after 1073.8 seconds. Packed setup failed after 206.6 seconds: the initial SDK global install hit the existing 180-second command timeout, before any launcher subcase. Stopped the already-failed V8 runner and its own descendant; final partial reporter counts 250 tests / 248 passed / 1 failed / 1 canceled / 0 skipped. Full package coverage and the later native-precondition release step were not reached. The independent pinned-pm acceptance run already reproduces all 18 fixed-clock/ABA failures. Starting the required Bun full gate serially with isolated identity and two workers. Current source CI is https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ado/actions/runs/40548756335, queued 0/4; no new-head CI test counts yet. SDK contract remains blocked on #1576."
  "2026-10-27T17:44:18.100Z",codex-agent,"R7 handoff: native monotonic preconditions remain BLOCKED on unbraind/pm-cli#1576, not fixed. Real-SDK fixed-clock probe covers nine import/export write boundaries with ordinary/ABA edits: 18 failing cases (19 tests including parent), 15 incorrect successes, six foreign titles overwritten, all native history heads advanced. No passing revert proof can be claimed for an unimplemented SDK contract; earlier replacement/review revert proofs remain recorded. Source c0c86882e2c44d52b29b6b530bd0f334e9c776c2 adds the blocking acceptance gate and covers previous branch gaps. Focused new cases 5/5, contracts/moves 32/32 at 100% lines/branches/functions, resolution/read-back 30/30; typecheck/build/docstrings pass. Local npm release check failed: 250 reported, 248 passed, one failed, one canceled. Local Bun failed: 186 reported, 181 passed, one failed, four canceled. Both failed the existing 180-second packed SDK installation timeout before launcher cases; remaining test runners were stopped after failure, no complete coverage/statement gate claim. CI https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ado/actions/runs/40548756335 remains queued (0/4 complete) at the bounded handoff. Pack dry-run and release attestation/date checks pass. No merge/release or upstream/thread messages. Release own claim; SDK follow-up stays open."
  "2026-10-27T20:06:11.835Z",codex-agent,"Round 5: close the monotonic precondition class using native history length plus last hash captured before inspection, SDK native writes, and under-lock read-back verification with selective append-only compensation. The approved fallback is required by unbraind/pm-cli#1576. Audit sync/import/recovery/agreement and resolution publication; preserve native lifecycle, runtime hooks and policy. Convert the existing fixed-clock/ABA acceptance probe to a passing contract; add compensation and recovery adversaries and function-only revert evidence. Fresh fetch: branch is 29 ahead, zero behind main, so no merge required. No non-blocking code findings appeared in the public PR reviews (review-provider trial notices supply no approval)."
  "2026-10-27T20:26:02.134Z",codex-agent,"R8 checkpoint: fixed-clock boundary probe passes 19/19 (18 ordinary/ABA cases plus parent), with every peer title/item preserved and ADO_CONFLICT returned. Native history verifier uses SDK workspace transactions and locked append-only compensation; no global hook registry replacement. Source/built standalone relation import and portable/legacy resolution ABA checks pass 7/7. Native recovery/peer-field checks pass 9/9. The original stale-import byte-preservation and scalar-to-close retry tests pass 2/2 after adding the early head check; SDK locked read-back remains necessary for a peer inside the subsequent native call. Auditing journal recovery and 100% coverage before release gates. Native expected-head support remains upstream pm-cli#1576; approved detect-after-write fallback now handles its package-level correctness gap."
  "2026-10-27T20:36:35.771Z",codex-agent,"R8 behavioral revert proof: in a disposable source copy only, removed the native-head refusal and post-write interleaving predicate from history-fence.ts, preserving SDK lifecycle execution, journal and compensation code. The unchanged fixed-clock command matrix then failed all 18 cases (19 failures including parent), with 15 incorrect successes and six peer titles lost; exit 1. The reviewed worktree was never altered by the revert. Restored linked npm run test:native-precondition passes 19/19, and linked native history suite passes 22/22, zero failures/skips/cancellations. Dedicated source coverage for the shared verifier is 100% lines/branches/functions (17/17 before adding four real SIGKILL cells plus parent); real SIGKILL dispatch/verification × ordinary/ABA passes 5/5. Differential rerun: 14/14 over 140 public items; source tracker bytes unchanged. Explicit differences: additive native head in portable plans and six audit entries versus the baseline single write (three native changes plus three immutable verification events); semantic receipts, fields and net patches remain equal. These results supersede the R7 expected-failure handoff; no failing acceptance is waived."
  "2026-10-27T20:51:51.234Z",codex-agent,"R8 final focused proof: the pm-linked strict native verifier command passes 32/32, zero failures/skips/cancellations, with unchanged 100% lines/branches/functions. This includes malformed/empty native head shapes, native same-clock/ABA races, legacy unsealed birth records, all five SDK journal transition interruptions, ordinary journal-failure compensation, real dispatch/verification SIGKILL cells, and eight tag/dependency before/after add/remove/clear combinations. Extra collection revert: restore whole-field later-value protection in a disposable copy; the unchanged eight-cell collection matrix reports seven failures and two passes including parent (exit 1). The fixed policy uses SDK stableValueEquals to apply later peer set edits to the pre-write state; restored strict matrix passes. No existing test assertion was weakened. Source/built and JSON/TOON/legacy resolution checkpoint passes 9/9; public differential rerun remains 14/14 across 140 items. Original named bulk match cannot carry native expected history/hash and its timestamp restore is ambiguous under a fixed clock, so the authorized replacement composes SDK native update, workspace coordinator, locked context mutation and SDK replay; upstream pm-cli#1576 remains a capability follow-up. Starting full npm then Bun release checks, two workers, isolated identity and credential-free public npm configuration."
  "2026-10-27T20:59:19.603Z",codex-agent,"R8 source freeze: final linked command/SDK checks pass 9/9, including ordinary, ABA and zero-value native audit entries against both new and legacy portable plans; native history advancement is asserted. Malformed heads refuse as invalid_plan and valid empty-but-stale heads refuse as stale_local. JSON/TOON artifact normalization checkpoint remains passing; configured storage reads still use one SDK lookup path, capturing the head after identity resolution and before the document read. Final typecheck/build/test compilation/docstrings pass (19 files, 115 declarations). Shared verifier strict coverage remains 32/32 at 100% lines/branches/functions. Preparing the source commit and running the complete release gates next; current package acceptance no longer depends on a failing test waiver."
  "2026-10-27T21:47:09.017Z",codex-agent,"Full npm attempt at source 5a853da stopped after three close-path assertions failed: 545 reported tests, 541 pass, three fail, one canceled; no aggregate or statement coverage certification. All six packed install shapes passed before the failures. Root cause was an SDK-equivalent scalar update omitting its history event, rather than a peer edit. The guard now appends a zero-value SDK audit witness under a locked head check, handles SDK refusals/post-write failures without swallowing peer conflicts, and waits for live peer leases without force. Isolated-identity focused no-op/refusal/post-write/lease and prior close cases pass 14/14. Isolated shared-verifier suite passes 44/44 at unchanged 100% lines/branches/functions; complete import-close edit/SIGKILL matrix passes 37/37. New no-op-specific revert removes only that SDK witness branch in a disposable copy: two failures/two passes (including parent), exit 1; restore is passing. Existing monotonic and collection revert proofs remain recorded. The first CI/source run is superseded by this correction; no failed gate is waived. Rerunning release gates serially on the corrected source."
  "2026-10-27T22:22:59.819Z",codex-agent,"Corrected-source Bun gate checkpoint: all eight import/export edit/SIGKILL scenarios pass; create/PATCH outcome models pass; the 500-sequence normalization/replay model passes (181 import, 152 export, 167 sync, 500 exact replays, 50 older replay refusals). The separate 512-sequence two-sided merge model remains active with no reported failure; no complete gate/coverage pass is claimed yet. Corrected source CI https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ado/actions/runs/40589672134 remains pending at the bounded CI-watch handoff; CodeQL is successful. Continuing required local validation rather than adding idle CI waits. npm follows Bun serially, with at most two workers and unchanged thresholds."
  "2026-10-27T22:32:14.752Z",codex-agent,"CI at source 5ea8a8257d69104f69545b49eab71f762ab8889e completed: all four Node 22/26 and npm/Bun jobs passed 770 tests with zero failures, cancellations or skips, then refused the unchanged 100% branch threshold at 99.79% (resolution 99.36%, sync 99.67%; native verifier 100/100/100). CodeQL passed 1/1. CI run https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ado/actions/runs/40589672134. Filling the untested refusal branches with real SDK trackers before rerunning; no gate waiver or threshold change. Local Bun merge model continues without a reported test failure."
  "2026-10-27T22:36:48.919Z",codex-agent,"Coverage follow-through: added real non-git SDK regressions for a fresh legacy headless plan (apply and history-identical replay), fixed-clock native edit during resolution agreement read-back (stale_local with peer title retained), strict native claim refusal (ADO_CONFLICT and actionable persistence message), and unavailable SDK anchors (ADO_USAGE). Focused round-8 suite passes 10/10. Removed only a redundant optional access after local object validation; this is a structurally unreachable branch, with malformed-head validation preserved. No existing tests or thresholds changed."
  "2026-10-27T22:37:22.792Z",codex-agent,"Linked test 19 rerun with --progress passes 12/12 across source and built standalone relation import, portable/legacy fixed-clock plans, fresh legacy replay, late resolution agreement race, strict native ownership refusal and missing SDK diagnostics. Typecheck, build, build:test and docstrings pass (19 files, 115 declarations); no separate lint script exists. Changelog full/check, public-additions and append-only history prefix checks pass."
  "2026-10-27T22:38:25.848Z",codex-agent,"Additional behavioural revert proof on the late-resolution case: in a disposable copy only, disable the shared native-head/read-back predicates; the fixed-clock edit during agreement read-back returns success and the regression fails (1 failed, exit 1, missing stale_local). The reviewed worktree was unchanged, and the restored implementation then passes 1/1. Exact current-source differential also passes 14/14 on 140 public items (32 ado, 108 jira), read-only source bytes unchanged; only documented history witnesses/audit ordering and internal base coordinates differ."
  "2026-10-27T22:46:08.545Z",codex-agent,"Local Bun V8 pass on the superseded 5ea8a8 source completed the full reference models: 512 two-sided sequences, seed 0x37a9c521, 278 interruptions, 408 converged retries and 104 typed conflicts, with no invariant failure. The separate 500-sequence normalization/replay model passed (181 import, 152 export, 167 sync, 500 exact replays, 50 older replays refused). Complete coverage is still being collected; fresh ea12ebc CI includes the refusal-coverage follow-up. Fresh fetch confirms no missing main commits. Strict tracker health passes, with one telemetry_queue_pending advisory and no telemetry changes. Separate out-of-scope throttling handling is tracked by pm-ado-outbox-throttling."
  "2026-10-27T22:49:18.101Z",codex-agent,"Completed local Bun gate on 5ea8a8: 770/770 tests, zero failures/cancellations/skips, 100% lines/functions, 99.79% branches; gate correctly exits 1 before statements and downstream release checks. Full local LCOV identifies legacy intent.patch raw-projection arms, missing ado_project fallback, non-directory recoverEffects storage and native ownership refusal. Added append-only legacy-intent apply/replay and real ENOTDIR/scope regressions alongside the earlier refusal cases; focused round-8 source suite now passes 12/12. No SDK mocks, history rewrites, test removal or threshold changes. Complete model results remain green. The corrected full gate will use installed supported Node 26 and at most two workers."
  "2026-10-27T22:49:41.142Z",codex-agent,"Final coverage follow-up linked test 19 passes 14/14 with --progress, including source/built relation writes, native plan/race/refusal cases, legacy prepared intents without remote_values (one PATCH then byte-identical replay), missing project scope and real ENOTDIR recovery. Typecheck and build:test pass after using the complete SDK list projection for legacy field fingerprints. Privacy and immutable history prefix checks pass."
  "2026-10-27T23:10:54.022Z",codex-agent,"Additional ownership instance found and reproduced: two concurrent native writers with the same operation id and inspected history head but different payloads could coalesce onto the first SDK journal and both return success. New real-SDK fixed-clock regression requires the second payload to conflict and preserves the first value. Bind operation identity to SDK deriveMutationTransactionId(JSON.stringify(options)) before the existing head-bound journal key. Recovery retains existing marker parsing, including legacy markers. The pre-fix regression failed 1/1 (second falsely fulfilled); fixed case passes 1/1. Stopped the superseded local Node 26 npm runner and its own child while adding this repair; all eight crash matrices and its 500-sequence model had passed, but its 512 model/coverage did not finish. No full-gate approval claimed."
  "2026-10-27T23:16:56.782Z",codex-agent,"Final payload ownership repair keeps stable operation prefixes: payload digest is native-payload marker metadata and part of the SDK-derived journal key, with optional legacy-marker parsing. All previous assertions remain; the corrupt-journal fixture targets the new exact key. Fresh complete native suite 45/45 passes strict 100% lines/branches/functions; fixed-clock/ABA probe 19/19; source/built/portable/legacy suite 14/14; full import-close edit/SIGKILL matrix 37/37; current differential 14/14 over 140 public items with source bytes unchanged. Reverting only payload binding in a disposable copy fails the new fixed-clock two-writer case 1/1 (false success); restored case passes 1/1. Earlier native/collection/no-op/late-agreement reverts remain recorded. Typecheck, build, build:test and docstrings pass (115/115)."
  "2026-10-27T23:16:57.833Z",codex-agent,"Full-gate evidence boundary: baseline f28e451 CI npm release gate passed 775/775 V8 tests and 775/775 AST tests, zero failures/skips/cancellations, 100% lines/branches/functions plus 2328/2328 statements across 13 required files, then native acceptance 19/19. Run https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ado/actions/runs/40597746480 ; CodeQL 1/1 passed, other three CI jobs were still pending at inspection. The final payload-key repair requires fresh exact-head npm/Bun CI; do not treat baseline approval as final-head approval. The superseded local npm run was stopped deliberately: partial 722 tests, 721 passed, zero assertion failures, one canceled. Earlier local Bun completed 770/770 tests but failed its then-uncovered branch threshold at 99.79%. Thresholds and timeouts unchanged. Both full release commands are linked; current full gates remain unverified at the bounded handoff. Production audit found zero vulnerabilities; package dry run, publish-attestation/date and strict health checks pass. No separate lint script. Two original audit findings handled, 175 production TypeScript lines deleted against main; SDK pre-write history API remains missing under pm-cli#1576 with the authorized verification/compensation fallback. Separate pre-existing HTTP 429 Retry-After work is tracked in pm-ado-outbox-throttling."
  "2026-10-27T23:18:14.206Z",codex-agent,"Final build housekeeping: include the generated native-fence declaration documentation and source map alongside the payload-key repair; public signatures are unchanged. The claim remains released and the item remains in_progress for orchestrator verification. Fresh exact-head CI is required after this final generated-output commit; no further CI waiting beyond the existing cutoff."
